      "reason": "behaviour differs from the original",
      "idea": "simplify the storage write enable: write the free slot whenever the FIFO is not full",
      "plan": "The storage write enable is wr_en AND not full, decoded for 16 slots. Writing the free slot on every cycle while the FIFO is not full removes wr_en from that logic; the written value only becomes visible once wr_ptr moves past the slot, so the queue contents should not change.",
